  item: { h: 'Two rulebooks, two profits', what: 'Every income and expense item is counted twice. **Accounting profit** follows SFRS(I). **Taxable profit** follows the Income Tax Act, and IRAS taxes it at 17%. The two profits differ because tax law treats some items differently, so the first question for each item is how tax law treats it.' },
